# Chronicling America

Before changing Chronicling America download or import code, read
**`.cursor/docs/chronicling-america.md`**.

Critical constraints (verified 2026-06-15):

- **Bulk mode (`--config`)** is the only fully working unattended path; use
  `chroniclingamerica.loc.gov` only.
- **`www.loc.gov` JSON API** returns Cloudflare `403`; use `--use-crawl` for single
  issues instead of the default API mode.
- OCR manifest URL is **`/data/ocr/ocr.json`** (legacy `/ocr.json` is dead).
- Default **`--delay` is 3.0 s**; rate limiting runs inside the request lock.
- Set **`start_date`/`end_date`** in download config for pilots; use writable scratch
  paths on clusters (not `/data`).
